## Enforcement and Governance

### Constitution Authority
This constitution is the **single source of truth** for development standards in the PDPw migration project. All team members, including AI assistants, MUST adhere to these guidelines.

### Updates and Amendments
- Constitution updates require approval from tech lead
- Major changes require team consensus
- Version history tracked in git

### Non-Compliance
- Pull requests not meeting standards will be rejected
- Repeated violations require team discussion
- Critical violations may require code rollback

